<https://w3id.org/mlips/entity/result-dp-Cu-han2018> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Deep Potential model for EAM Cu on Bulk copper, heated from 500 K to 2400 K and cooled back (256 atoms)" .
<https://w3id.org/mlips/entity/result-dp-Zr-han2018> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Deep Potential model for Zr on Solid zirconium with randomly displaced atoms (radiation-damage model, 8000-atom supercells)" .
<https://w3id.org/mlips/entity/result-dp-water-han2018> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Deep Potential model for liquid water on Liquid water at 300 K and 1 atm (64 molecules, path-integral AIMD)" .
